{"id":2642,"title":{"romaji":"Shirobako Movie","english":"SHIROBAKO the Movie","native":"劇場版 SHIROBAKO"},"slug":"shirobako_movie","synopsis":"The story is set four years after the events of the original *Shirobako* anime. Aoi Miyamori keeps busy dealing with the ordinary troubles in her daily work at Musashino Animation. After a morning meeting, Watanabe talks to Aoi and puts her in charge of a new theatrical anime project for the studio. The project has unexpected problems, and Aoi is unsure if the company can proceed with a theatrical anime with its current state of affairs. While dealing with that anxiety, Aoi meets a new colleague named Kaede Miyai. She and the MusAni team work together to complete the project.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"MOVIE","season":"WINTER","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:35","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 07:54:20","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":37804},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":101574},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":41255},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14061},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22595},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":10132},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5271,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/g64ZQrB80XolWytWjIB57Pb5Nu3BhQEh9wR628mW.jpg"},{"id":5272,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/XnLk7QdeQzNkktk32dW2HUvFzDQf1FbJjSnHt1oa.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":18,"name":"P.A. Works","slug":"pa_works"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":389,"name":"Shirobako","slug":"shirobako"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":10061,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":10062,"title":{"romaji":"Shikatanai no de Yareyare","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11803,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12061,"basename":"ShirobakoMovie-OP1.webm","filename":"ShirobakoMovie-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/ShirobakoMovie-OP1.